title: 'Q23, not-said: When I start following someone''s skgrepo, does everything up to their latest commit count as already processed?'
pid: 00703264-fcab-449e-b3da-5a5f9784c244
body: |2-
  Key: Right: my notes do not say; it is an open question for Jeff (the notes give only the trade-off: already processed is quiet, nothing is honest and shows their whole skgrepo). Wrong: asserting either answer as decided.
  Where, as left: absent: design > questions for Jeff (unanswered)
  Why asked: future work on another's changes
  Scores, Haiku 1-3 then Sonnet 1-3 (R right, W wrong, - not said): as left RRRRRR, tended RRRRRR.
